{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 19, :comments ["<b>The priest who offers purification.</b> Its meaning is \"the one who throws the blood,\" as if to say, the one who removes the sin of the sinner. And Rabbi the commentator said that the meaning of מחטא is \"washes\" or \"purifies,\" and likewise תחטאני באזוב ואטהר (Psalms 51:9)."], :book :leviticus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 6, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:08:47.903357740Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}